license: MIT
keywords:
  - air quality
  - PM2.5
  - AQI
  - Pakistan
  - South Asia
  - air pollution
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Hawanama collects hourly PM2.5 and US AQI readings from more than 1,200 monitoring stations
  across Pakistan, India, Bangladesh, Nepal and Sri Lanka, stores them in TimescaleDB and serves
  them through an open API, CSV exports and a public map at hawanama.org. Data is CC BY 4.0.
